Context window, API Pricing

    Context Window: Max no of tokens that a model can consider when generating the next token.

    Interesting:
        When it's generating a sentence. It's won't generate all the text at tokens at once.
        It generate 1st token and that 1st token will be passed in input and again next token will be generated

        for example:
            If a LLM is generating "Hi Akhil, How may I assist you"
            1.  First it will generate "Hi" token
            2.  This "Hi" will be feed into input prompt and again it will predict the next token i.e " Ak"
            3.  Then this "Hi" and " Ak" will be feed into input prompt and "hil" will be predicted..
            So to generate each token all the token before and during generation should be feed into input prompt.

